              "message" : "<p>We see there are <strong>3</strong> circular payment chains 4 hops in length that start and end in account <strong>934</strong>.</p>\n<p>Now we want to check how many circular payment of chains there are if we choose the chain length to be <strong>5</strong> hops.</p>\n",
