        "message" : [
          "%md",
          "The fraud department has now also confirmed that **934** and **387** might have been involved in illegal activities. Chances are that accounts that received money from accounts **934** or 387 have also been part of the scheme, and maybe the accounts that received money from them. The \"closer\" an account is to 934 or 387, the higher the risk.",
          "We use the **Personalized PageRank algorithm**, which computes **PageRank** values relative to a collection of vertices, which in this case is **934** and **387**.",
          "We use the Python API again.",
          "The code snippet uses the PgxGraph object graph containing a handle to the BANK_GRAPH we got earlier.",
          "It invokes the **Personalized PageRank** algorithm with the built-in analyst Python object. "
        ],
